// Ch1 C1-01 and C1-02 (docs/kb/story/beats/act1_ch01.md): the title card, then the drop. The
// Prologue's vigil cuts to black; a plain card; the tether runs through its block; fade up on U01,
// Rhen on his tether in the crown of a drowned Lit Age tower, the hulls of Oruvel a dark lattice on
// the bright surface above. Calm and competent, and alone. Letterboxed, then the field.
// The card is a caption over black (no chapter name: that is the pause menu's): #card shows it as UI's ActCard
// caption (M2-FP-121), and the scene starts black under it. The chapter flow
// sets ch01_started here, and Game.set_chapter(1) (ADR 0018's chapter autosave) with the shared
// {"chapter": 1} step once it lands (M2-FP-25).
// Music: silence, then oruvel_underway. Light: the oil lamp on his shoulder (N-02); no glimmer.
title: ch01_the_drop
location: ch01/oruvel_underway
---
@letterbox on
@music silence
One month earlier. #line:ch01_drop_001 #card #tn:"Title card, centred on black. The Prologue is set a month after this chapter."
@sfx tether_run
@wait 1.0
@camera U01
@music oruvel_underway fade=4.0
@fade in 3.0
@wait 1.5
Narrator(rhen) [neutral]: Oruvel sat on top of a drowned city. Most mornings I went down to take some of it home. #line:ch01_drop_002 #vo
@wait 1.0
@letterbox off
@camera release
===
